; LOAD FIDELITY — the variable table is CLEARED between top-level expressions.
; Upstream load_all_sexpr_impl (space.rs:856) `it.variables.clear()` runs every iteration.
; Ours Space.jl:219 `empty!(ctx.variables)` -- same, unconditional.
; DISCRIMINATOR: `$y` is the SECOND variable of expr 1. If the table were NOT cleared, `$y`
;   in expr 2 would resolve to VarRef(1) and upstream would render it `$b`; a cleared table
;   makes it a fresh NewVar -> `$a`.
; UPSTREAM GROUND TRUTH: (two $a) (three $a) (one $a $b)   -> table IS cleared.
; OURS should read: (two $) (three $) (one $ $).
(one $x $y)
(two $y)
(three $z)
